    {
      "id": "s14",
      "type": "CROWD_MATCH",
      "transition": "zoom",
      "background": "zoneB",
      "narration": "Sometimes position really is what you mean. The top search result. The newest message at the bottom. For those there is first, last, and nth. But nth counts from zero, so nth of two is the third one, not the second.",
      "data": {
        "crowdMatch": {
          "query": "get_by_test_id(\"search-result\")",
          "pageTitle": "Search results",
          "countLabel": "results",
          "pickIndex": 2,
          "pickLabel": ".nth(2) = third",
          "caption": "nth counts from zero. always.",
          "color": "blue",
          "atWord": 1.833,
          "pickAtWord": 21.417,
          "members": [
            {
              "label": "Playwright docs"
            },
            {
              "label": "Playwright GitHub"
            },
            {
              "label": "Playwright tutorial"
            },
            {
              "label": "Playwright vs Cy"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "durationFrames": 440,
      "audio": "audio/pw-dojo-10-many-elements_long_s14.mp3",
      "timingSource": "tts"
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "type": "CODE_RUN",
      "transition": "push",
      "background": "zoneA",
      "narration": "Here they are in code. First clicks the top one, which is a real idea a person would say. Last scrolls to the one at the bottom. And nth of two clicks the third, because the counting starts at zero.",
      "data": {
        "codeRun": {
          "filename": "position.py",
          "language": "py",
          "resultLabel": "what it picks",
          "caption": "first, last, and one by number",
          "color": "blue",
          "atWord": 2.417,
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "results = page.get_by_test_id("
            },
            {
              "text": "    \"search-result\")"
            },
            {
              "text": ""
            },
            {
              "text": "results.first.click()",
              "detail": "the top one, a real idea",
              "sub": "clicks result number 1",
              "label": "first",
              "atWord": 7.5
            },
            {
              "text": "results.last.scroll_into_view_if_needed()",
              "detail": "the one at the bottom",
              "sub": "scrolls to the last one",
              "label": "last",
              "atWord": 16.083
            },
            {
              "text": "results.nth(2).click()",
              "detail": "and this one is the THIRD",
              "sub": "because counting starts at 0",
              "label": "nth",
              "atWord": 21.833
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "durationFrames": 366,
      "audio": "audio/pw-dojo-10-many-elements_long_s15.mp3",
      "timingSource": "tts"
    },
